SUMMARY:Urbanist PowerPoint Party! Jan 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join 5th Square Advocacy for an evening of community-building +
  urbanist storytelling! \nHear from 5th Square Advocacy members and subjec
 t matter experts about a range of topics relevant to our built environment
 .\n\nPresenting Topics:\n- Philly’s Intercity Bus Saga + Future: Ben She
 \, 5th Square Organizer\n- Transit Funding: Stephen Bronskill\, Coalition 
 Manager of Transit Forward Philly\n- Roosevelt Blvd Subway: Will Tung\, 5t
 h Square Organizer\n- PA Administration: Gabriel Straus\, Philly Bike Acti
 on Board Member\n- Reforming Bike Parking: Morgan Allgrove-Hodges\, Transi
 t Committee Co-Chair for 5th Square Advocacy\n\n$10 suggested donation all
 ows us to buy a hoagie tray\, beer\, and seltzer! \n\nCome prepared to soc
 ialize! Presenters will be available to chat and answer questions after th
 e presentations.\n\nTransit Access:\n- Regional Rail to Suburban Station\n
 - L\, B and T lines to City Hall / 15th St station\n- SEPTA Bus: 2\, 4\, 9
 \, 12\, 16\, 17\, 21\, 27\, 31\, 32\, 33\, 38\, 42\, 44\, 48\, 62\, 124\, 
 125\n\nDetails & registration: https://5thsq.app.neoncrm.com/np/clients/5t
 hsq/event.jsp?event=10
LOCATION:Resurrection Church\, Chapel Space\, 123 S 17th Street 2nd floor\,
  Philadelphia\, PA 19103
URL:https://5thsq.app.neoncrm.com/np/clients/5thsq/event.jsp?event=10
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
