SUMMARY:Urbanist Fireside Chat with Angela Brooks
DESCRIPTION:Join 5th Square Advocacy’s Housing Committee for a “firesid
 e chat” event with city planner Angela D. Brooks who serves as the City 
 of Philadelphia's Chief Housing and Urban Development Officer\, and is Imm
 ediate Past President of the American Planning Association (APA). In her r
 ole in City Hall\, Angela oversees the Housing Opportunities Made Easy (H.
 O.M.E.) Plan to create and preserve 30\,000 housing units during Mayor Che
 relle Parker’s tenure.\n\n$10 suggested donation allows us to buy a hoag
 ie tray\, beer\, and seltzer! \n\nPublic & Active Transportation:\n- L-Lin
 e (Market-Frankford Line) to Spring Garden Station\n- G-Line (15 Trolley) 
 is a 10 minute walk away\n- Bus routes: 5\, 25\, 43\, 57\n- Indego Station
  and abundant bicycle racks on 2nd & Brown\n\nDetails & registration: http
 s://5thsq.app.neoncrm.com/np/clients/5thsq/event.jsp?event=18
LOCATION:Indy Hall\, 709 N 2nd St 3rd Floor\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123
URL:https://5thsq.app.neoncrm.com/np/clients/5thsq/event.jsp?event=18
STATUS:CONFIRMED
