SUMMARY:Housing Happy Hour
DESCRIPTION:Join 5th Square Advocacy at Jaxx Steaks' Taproom to celebrate h
 ousing wins in the city council\, state legislature\, and federal governme
 nt! We will hear from 5th Square organizers about upcoming campaigns\, tal
 k about getting bills like ADU legalization and the 'Golden Girls' Law acr
 oss the finish line\, and mingle with other pro-housing peers. All attende
 es will need to purchase their own drinks/food at Jaxx. \n\nHousing Happy 
 Hour \nWednesday\, July 8\, 6pm-8pm\nJaxx Steaks' Taproom\n242 Wharton St\
 nPhiladelphia\, PA 19147\n\nDetails & registration: https://5thsq.app.neon
 crm.com/np/clients/5thsq/event.jsp?event=28
LOCATION:Jaxx Steaks Taproom\, 242 Wharton Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19147
